Package: otoform
Title: Otolith Contour Shape Analysis via À Trous Wavelet Decomposition
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alberto", "Díaz", , "argdz@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-6961-4235"))
Description: Analyzes otolith contours through à trous wavelet decomposition
    (B3-spline) applied to centroid-distance signatures, as an alternative
    to Fourier descriptors for morphometric classification.
